le  alongside caitlyn for the spotted  sheriff and try to fill the power vacuum  at the top  however the plan is now to continue with  arcane only as already communicated in  an interview in the la times ride and  high when they say aiming high they are  not talking about another series but  about hollywood the mcu serves as a  great model for this in other words they  want a rune terror cinematic universe  and let's face it this is not  unthinkable if we shift the setting to  ionia and noxus then we can't help but  call demacia into play at some point and  by then the whole concept will have  reached a magnitude of possible  storylines that could fall vast number  of series and films basically arcane has  shown a new what made right great they  did not reinvent the wheel rather they  analyzed the best features of the  opposition and combined them into one  product for that reason alone we have  high hopes for their work and are  already looking forward to what is to  come in the future however for the time  being the second season of arcane won't  be available on netflix until 2023 this  is of course hard to accept but good  things come to those who wait  we could and would like to go on  philosophizing and analyzing for hours  but we want there to be room for your  creativity what theories do you have in  mind from season 1 and which characters  do you really want to see featured in  season 2 make sure to let us know in the  comments below and if you like this  video give us a thumbs up we really  appreciate it see you next time  [Music]  you

